# PUSH—Push Word, Doubleword, or Quadword Onto the Stack -- override
# The manual's Operation by stack-address size, through the Push helper
# (lib.sdm) so the value is taken before the stack pointer changes ("PUSH
# RSP pushes the value of RSP as it existed before the instruction was
# executed", Description); PUSH Sreg pushes the selector, zero-extended.
@operation
IF SegmentOperand
    THEN Push(SregValue);
    ELSE Push(SRC);
FI;
